# BACKUP_DIRECTORY defaults here, so a local `mealbells:backup` leaves a full
# database dump in the working tree. Untracked and unignored, one `git add -A`
# commits every employee's name and email into the repository.
/storage/backups
# Where a company export is written before being handed over. The command
# deletes it after sending, but a crash mid-download would leave a zip of every
# employee's name and address in the working tree.
/storage/app/exports
